  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_1442.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La pista deportiva municipal en el barrio Arrabal del Castillo se ha llenado a rebosar la noche de este jueves de personas para contemplar el espect&aacute;culo de variedades, con las atracciones principales de Falshback Magic y la &#39;vedette&#39; Roc&iacute;o Madrid, que ha contado con dos bailarines de excepci&oacute;n.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1379.jpg\" alt=\"img_1379\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1380.jpg\" alt=\"img_1380\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1381.jpg\" alt=\"img_1381\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1382.jpg\" alt=\"img_1382\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1383.jpg\" alt=\"img_1383\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1385.jpg\" alt=\"img_1385\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1386.jpg\" alt=\"img_1386\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/espectaclevarietatsravalcastell14/img_1387.jpg\" alt=\"img_1387\" style